<decision #harden-xnl-authoring-mutations.identity-role {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
}
(
  <question ?>#id 在 mutation diff 中是匹配键还是普通可更新字段？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>#id 用来比较树并识别 move，不参与普通字段比较。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Track SHALL 保持 #id 的 identity-key 语义，不新增 #id update mutation。</?>
    <rationale ?>更新 identity 会破坏节点对齐、move 检测和引用稳定性。</?>
    <evidence ?>现有 diffArray/readIdOrMetadaataId 实现与用户明确纠正。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #harden-xnl-authoring-mutations.compatibility {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
}
(
  <question ?>是否把现有 applyMutations 直接改为 immutable transaction？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>保留低层 API，新增严格 authoring batch API。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Existing mutable applyMutations SHALL remain compatible; dry-run/atomic behavior SHALL use a new explicit API。</?>
    <rationale ?>避免未审计调用方因返回 identity 或 mutation side effect 改变而发生隐式 breaking change。</?>
    <evidence ?>xnl-core 0.1.9 已公开 applyMutations，多个项目按 mutable clone-and-apply 方式消费。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #harden-xnl-authoring-mutations.identity-policy {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P1"
}
(
  <question ?>严格事务 API 是否要求所有 XNL element 都有 #id？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>通用 XNL 默认允许缺失，authoring consumer 显式选择严格策略。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Identity policy SHALL be configurable; default allows missing identities while always rejecting duplicates among identities that exist。</?>
    <rationale ?>XNL 是通用表示语言，文档 authoring 的强 identity 要求不应破坏普通解析和 mutation 场景。</?>
    <evidence ?>现有 parser 与 fixtures 允许无 #id element，Mission 只要求可编辑结构具备稳定 identity。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #harden-xnl-authoring-mutations.strict-id-mutation {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
}
(
  <question ?>strict batch 如何处理调用方手工构造的 element id 字段 mutation？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>严格入口拒绝，legacy apply 保持兼容；身份变化用 delete/add。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Strict batch SHALL return IDENTITY_MUTATION_FORBIDDEN for direct element id field mutation, while legacy applyMutations remains unchanged。</?>
    <rationale ?>只禁止 diff 生成 id update 仍允许外部调用方绕过 identity 语义；严格入口必须闭合读取与写入两侧。</?>
    <evidence ?>Fresh coding AttractorCheck 发现 applySingle 当前只拦 metadata.id，普通 :id path 仍可由 setPathValue 写入。</?>
  )
  >
)>
